1. Migration slots are not implementable as written. Packet claims v200/v201 and “highest migration ... v178” (`L0-packet...:13,30,82`), but repo has v240 registered (`src-tauri/src/migrations.rs:927`) and runner applies only `version > current` (`src-tauri/src/migrations.rs:3500`). v200/v201 can be skipped on DBs already at v240.

2. Cycle 5 trait surface is under-specified. Packet lists only `SignalEmitter` method names and omits `Send + Sync` (`L0-packet...:44-45`); wave plan pins exact trait bounds and method signatures (`v1.4.5-waves.md:449-458`). Fresh agent must guess parameters.

